# Project Overview

This project is a personal finance management application.

## Current Scope

- Front-end only.
- Back-end will be implemented later.

## Mock Data

All screens must use mock data that mirrors the shape of future REST API responses.

- Keep mock data in dedicated files (e.g. `src/mocks/`).
- Structure mock objects to match expected API response contracts.
- Never inline hardcoded data directly inside components.

## Design Principles

- Prioritize scalability, maintainability and reusable components.
- Build components in isolation so they can be wired to real API calls with minimal changes.
- Avoid coupling UI logic to data-fetching concerns — use hooks or service layers as an abstraction boundary.
